abstract: >-
  Open, reproducible conceptual designs, schematics, instructions, models, and
  simulations for a photonic voxel memory/compute architecture (OPGPU), including
  strategies/families A–G and candidate combinations H1–H5 (H3, G2, G3, H1, H4),
  PCIe/OpenCL/OpenVINO compatibility paths, manufacturability/thermal analyses,
  and feasibility simulations (S1–S4). Intended for universal use and as
  defensive publication/prior art; not validated experimentally and not
  fabrication/certification-ready.
